## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
##  PRIVATE ENVIRONMENT DATA — never commit
##  This repository is PUBLIC. Anything describing the real
##  network (host names, IPs, tenant/client IDs, credentials)
##  lives in private/ and must stay out of git history.
## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore the CONTENTS of private/, not the directory itself: git does not
# descend into an ignored directory, so a negation inside "private/" would
# never be reached. "private/*" leaves the directory walkable.
private/*
!private/README.md
!private/environment.template.md

# Secrets, certs, local overrides
*.env
.env*
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.publishsettings
*.pubxml.user

## ── .NET ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
artifacts/
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.trx

## ── Node (only if the optional Tailwind build is used) ──────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.tailwindcss-cache

## ── Editors / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
